Threski Studio
Copyright 2026 fatterdev

This product is a living project memory system for real codebases: an MCP
knowledge graph built from git causality, polyglot ast-grep structure, AI
rule synthesis, log analysis, ticketing, and typed team memory, persisted in
a single SurrealDB knowledge graph.

Project home: https://github.com/fatterdev/threski-studio
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This product includes and relies on third-party software and services:

* SurrealDB (https://surrealdb.com) - persistence engine; the SurrealDB
  binary is auto-provisioned on demand when enabled.
* ast-grep (https://ast-grep.github.io) - structural code search; the `sg`
  sidecar binary is auto-provisioned on demand when enabled.
* Ollama (https://ollama.com) - optional local embeddings and chat runtime,
  started on demand.
* Rust ecosystem crates (tokio, axum, serde, and others) - complete list in
  Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock.
* Node.js packages shipped with ide-host and vscode-extension - complete
  list in their package.json / package-lock.json.

